}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "application/octet-stream", "state": "uploaded", "size": 1527, "digest": "sha256:3ab7a8977f3d7745f7a56a3e200c6312d1cf40852d8ab6d9751c46ff333589d4", "download_count": 0, "created_at": "2026-10-20T12:29:32Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-20T12:29:32Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/download/v3.1.8/trust_publisher.bat"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/tarball/v3.1.8", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.1.8", "body": "## Pulse Music v3.1.8 (OTA Update for Android & Windows)\n\n### 🚀 Update Engine & CDN Prioritization\n- CDN Prioritization (cdn.jsdelivr.net & raw GitHub) completely eliminates GitHub API 60-req/hr rate limiting (403 errors on shared mobile carrier CGNAT IPs).\n- 64-bit ID & Asset Deserialization: Full support for GitHub 64-bit integer IDs and multi-gigabyte asset sizes, permanently eliminating \"Server Error 200\" crashes.\n- Friendly error notifications: Clear, graceful UI alerts replacing cryptic raw HTTP status codes.\n\n### 🎵 Enhanced Lyrics Accuracy & Quality\n- Strict title matching prevents irrelevant song lyrics from being matched.\n- Empty lyrics filtering: Completely eliminates blank lyrics cards from playback screens.\n\n### 🌐 Listen Together Latency & Reconnection\n- Fixed coroutine cleanup race condition preventing secondary room connections.\n- Purged stale room tokens on leave/disconnect to ensure immediate room rejoin.\n- Reduced handshake and socket timeouts for faster session initialization.\n\n### ⚡ General Performance & Stability\n- Polished stability across Android & Windows platforms.\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/418373528/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}}